$$\Lambda \sim \frac{1}{\text{Tr}(H)}$$
$$\text{Clock Adjustment} = \frac{\text{Base Clock}}{\text{Tr}(H) + \epsilon}$$
$$\Lambda_{\text{tuned}} = \max\left(\text{Clock Adjustment}, 1e-10\right)$$

