$$H_{\text{stabilized}} = H + \rho_{\text{floor}} \cdot I$$
$$\text{Det}_{\text{raw}} = \det(H_{\text{stabilized}})$$
$$\text{Normalized Determinant} = \frac{\det(H_{\text{stabilized}})}{\det(H_{\text{stabilized}})} = 1.0 \quad (\text{Rigid Normalization})$$

