$$\text{Total Input Information Flux} = \sum (m_i \cdot S_i)$$
$$\text{Output Information State} = \text{Total Input Info} \cdot (1.0 + H_{\text{logic}})$$
$$\text{Conservation Condition:} \quad \text{Output Info} > 0 \implies \text{Stability Status: LOCKED}$$

