$$\text{Resource Allocation Sort:} \quad \text{Sorted Priorities by Weight } (W_i \ge W_{i+1})$$
$$\text{Bandwidth Allocation:} \quad \text{Load}_i = \min(\text{Demand}_i, \text{Remaining Bandwidth})$$
$$\text{Engel's Law Mapping (HIP Priority):} \quad W_{\text{Food}} > W_{\text{Investment}} > W_{\text{Luxury}}$$

