$$\text{Brooks's Coordination Entropy Cost:} \quad E_{\text{coordination}} = n \cdot (n - 1) \cdot \alpha_{\text{penalty}}$$
$$\text{Computing System Goal:} \quad \text{Maximize parallel speedup while minimizing network communication entropy}$$

