$$\text{SRP Compliance Rule:} \quad \text{Module Overlap} < 0.1$$
$$\text{System Macro Stability:} \quad \text{Stability} = \begin{cases} \text{HIGH}, & \text{KISS} \land \text{SRP} \\ \text{LOW}, & \text{Otherwise} \end{cases}$$

